# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vercel SPA Fallback (processed before vercel.json rewrites)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Routes all unmatched paths to /index.html so React Router
# can handle client-side routing. Also prevents the static
# 404.html from overriding the SPA fallback.
#
# The 200 status code at the end tells Vercel to serve the
# content and return HTTP 200 (not a redirect).
#
# Documentation: https://vercel.com/docs/edge-network/redirects
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

/* /index.html 200
